        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if instead of sending your little pets out to battle one another, they raced instead?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Pet Racers</strong> is a 2.5D auto racer where you obtain pet trainers to pour the stats and abilities that they offer into your trainee pet runner to win races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every great racer needs a great team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your lineup of trainers and shape your pet’s stats, abilities, and racing style over the course of a season. Plan your weekly schedule, choose who to train with, and enter races to prove your pet’s worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different stats, abilities, and outsmart rival racers on the path to win all your races.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if instead of sending your little pets out to battle one another, they raced instead?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Pet Racers</strong> is a 2.5D auto racer where you obtain pet trainers to pour the stats and abilities that they offer into your trainee pet runner to win races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every great racer needs a great team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your lineup of trainers and shape your pet’s stats, abilities, and racing style over the course of a season. Plan your weekly schedule, choose who to train with, and enter races to prove your pet’s worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different stats, abilities, and outsmart rival racers on the path to win all your races.</p>",
        "short_description": "A 2.5D pet racing simulator where you train your pets to run fast and hit hard. Build their speed to outrun the pack or train their wisdom to proc abilities that debuff others. Cute pets, Chaotic Abilities. Many Racers, 1 Winner.",
